    "original": "「背高いの羨ましい」「そう？ でも背高くてもいいことなんて何もないよ。天井に頭ぶつけたりするし」",
    "en": [
      {
        "id": "4515068",
        "text": "\"I'm jealous of your height.\" \"Really? There's nothing good about being tall. You hit your head on the ceiling and all that.\""
      },
      {
        "id": "4515082",
        "text": "\"It must be great to be tall.\" \"Do you think so? It's not really that great. You keep bumping your head on the ceiling.\""
